Usage: agent-deck list [options]

List all sessions.
JSON includes transcript_path and native IDs when known; paths belong to the session host.
ACCOUNT shows the quoted stored account slot, not a resolved account or login identity.
JSON always includes the raw "account" string, including "" when no slot is stored.

Options:
  -all
    	List sessions from all profiles
  -cursor string
    	With --sync: the cursor of the previous reply (none: a full listing)
  -focus string
    	With --sync: refresh only these comma-separated ids plus running, waiting, starting, conductor and favourite sessions
  -include-superseded
    	Include archived source rows retained for cross-harness recovery
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -limit int
    	With --sync: most rows and removed ids per reply (0: no limit)
  -no-archived
    	Skip archived sessions (no status work or output for them); for pollers that only need live sessions
  -page string
    	With --sync: the next token of a paged full listing
  -scope string
    	With --sync: active, archived or all (default "all")
  -stats
    	
  -sync
    	With --json: one-line sync envelope of what changed since --cursor, for remote pollers

Examples:
  agent-deck list                    # List from default profile
  agent-deck -p work list            # List from 'work' profile
  agent-deck list --all              # List from all profiles
  agent-deck list --json --no-archived  # Live listing without archived sessions
